# Non-investigation directories (full Azazael ecosystem)
# azazael/ removed 2026-11-16: that path is now a junction to
# C:/Azazael/azazael, and the agent file tools honour .gitignore, so the
# exclusion made the entire workspace invisible to glob. The entries below
# are anchored with a leading '/' because an unanchored name matches at ANY
# depth under gitignore semantics, which is what hid azazael/src, azazael/tests
# and azazael/tools. .git/info/exclude must NOT list the junction either --
# measured 2026-11-16: the tools read that file too, and re-excluding it there
# returned glob azazael/src/* -> 0 while azazael/* -> 276.
/azazael-dev/
/.azazael/
/.libra/
/.ollama/
/.agents/
/.audit/
/.config/
/.docker/
/.dotnet/
/.github/
/.keras/
